   "text": "財神廟舉辦抽發財金活動：參加者抽兩次籤，每次抽籤出現「吉」、「祥」的機率皆為 <span class='frac small'><span class='num'>1</span><span class='den'>3</span></span>。如果兩次都抽得「吉」，獲得獎金 180 元；如果兩次都抽得「祥」，獲得獎金 90 元；其餘情況則無獎金。試問參加者可獲獎金的期望值為何？",
   "options": {
    "1": "20 元",
    "2": "30 元",
    "3": "45 元",
    "4": "60 元",
    "5": "90 元"
   },
   "answer": "2",
   "steps": [
    "每次抽籤「吉」的機率是 <span class='frac small'><span class='num'>1</span><span class='den'>3</span></span>，兩次獨立，所以兩次都「吉」的機率 = <span class='frac small'><span class='num'>1</span><span class='den'>3</span></span>×<span class='frac small'><span class='num'>1</span><span class='den'>3</span></span> = <span class='frac small'><span class='num'>1</span><span class='den'>9</span></span>。",
