</span><span><i>v</i><sub>3</sub></span></span> 滿足 <i>A</i><i>v</i> = <span style='display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(1,auto);gap:0 .7em;padding:0 .45em;border-left:1.5px solid;border-right:1.5px solid;border-radius:3px;vertical-align:middle;text-align:center;line-height:1.35'><span>1</span><span>0</span><span>1</span></span> 且 <i>v</i> 垂直於行向量 <span style='display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(1,auto);gap:0 .7em;padding:0 .45em;border-left:1.5px solid;border-right:1.5px solid;border-radius:3px;vertical-align:middle;text-align:center;line-height:1.35'><span>0</span><span>1</span><span>0</span></span>？",
